@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Ingest a plain-text document
POST {{host}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "return-policy",
  "title": "Return policy",
  "content": "Customers may request a refund within 30 calendar days of purchase. A receipt or order number is required. Final-sale items cannot be returned."
}

### Ask a supported question
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the refund window?",
  "maxResults": 5
}

### Ask a question the document does not support
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Where is the lunar research laboratory?"
}

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
